---
import TitleLv2 from "../common/TitleLv2.astro";
---

<section class="works-basic-design">
  <div class="l-container">
    <div class="l-section">
      <TitleLv2 title="課題解決のための基本設計"/>
      <div class="l-section-body">
        <ul class="works-basic-design-card">
          <li class="works-basic-design-card-item">
            <div class="works-basic-design-title-lv3">
              <span class="works-basic-design-title-lv3-number">01</span>
              <h3 class="works-basic-design-title-lv3-text">情報設計</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="works-basic-design-list c-list-green-line">
              <li class="works-basic-design-item c-list-green-line-item">スタジオの強みの言語化・新規顧客にも伝わる言葉に整理</li>
              <li class="works-basic-design-item c-list-green-line-item">サービスメニューを見やすく整理</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="works-basic-design-card-item">
            <div class="works-basic-design-title-lv3">
              <span class="works-basic-design-title-lv3-number">02</span>
              <h3 class="works-basic-design-title-lv3-text">導線設計</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="works-basic-design-list c-list-green-line">
              <li class="works-basic-design-item c-list-green-line-item">体験予約導線を整理し、予約サイトへ一本化</li>
              <li class="works-basic-design-item c-list-green-line-item">スマートフォンでも迷わない導線設計</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="works-basic-design-card-item">
            <div class="works-basic-design-title-lv3">
              <span class="works-basic-design-title-lv3-number">03</span>
              <h3 class="works-basic-design-title-lv3-text">運用設計</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="works-basic-design-list c-list-green-line">
              <li class="works-basic-design-item c-list-green-line-item">更新頻度は低いため、CMSは非採用</li>
              <li class="works-basic-design-item c-list-green-line-item">将来の拡張性を考慮した設計</li>
              <li class="works-basic-design-item c-list-green-line-item">セキュリティ管理にコストをかけない設計</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div><!-- /.l-section-body -->
    </div><!-- /.l-section -->
  </div><!-- /.l-container -->
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use '../../styles/breakpoints' as *;

  .works-basic-design {
    background-color: var(--color-sub);
  }

  .works-basic-design-card {
    display: grid;
    gap: 48px;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .works-basic-design-title-lv3 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 38px 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .works-basic-design-title-lv3-number {
    color: var(--color-main);
    font-size: 28px;
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .works-basic-design-title-lv3-text {
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: .05em;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .works-basic-design-list {
    margin-block-start: 20px;
  }

  @include mq() {
    .works-basic-design-card {
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .works-basic-design-title-lv3 {
      grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .works-basic-design-title-lv3-number {
      margin-block-end: 3px;
      font-size: 31px;
    }

    .works-basic-design-title-lv3-text {
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .works-basic-design-list {
      margin-block-start: 24px;
    }
  }

</style>
